+/// The scroll multiplier for a wheel event.
+///
+/// Programs that read the mouse (mouse mode) get one report per line of
+/// scroll and scroll their own amount per report, so a wheel notch stays one
+/// report. Touchpad (pixel) deltas get the multiplier there too: a compositor
+/// that scales scrolling down (sway's `scroll_factor`) otherwise leaves a
+/// touchpad swipe a report or two.
+fn scroll_multiplier(mouse_mode: bool, pixels: bool, multiplier: f64) -> f64 {
+    if mouse_mode && !pixels { 1. } else { multiplier }
+}
